('shiva-madhya-pradesh-oon-ballaleshvara-temple-oon', 'shiva', 'Ballaleshvara Temple (Oon)', NULL, 'Madhya Pradesh', 'Oon', 'Oon village, Khargone district', 'Shiva', 'Shaiva', 'Ballaleshvara Temple is a state-protected Shiva monument in Oon, associated in local tradition with the son of King Udayaditya.', NULL, 'Dome above a sunken garbhagriha.', NULL, 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/0102221_Ballaleswar_temple,_Un_056.jpg', 'Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:0102221_Ballaleswar_temple,_Un_056.jpg', 'Morning light for architectural details.', 'Open daily; timings vary by season.', 'Modest attire recommended.', 'Heritage site with later repairs and uneven floors.', '["Un Temples","Dome","Heritage"]', '["Heritage darshan"]', '["Mahashivratri"]', 'The Ballaleshwar temple is a mid 11th-century Shiva temple in Un village, notable for its dome-like superstructure added in later repairs.', 'It faces east with a square inner plan and an outer pancharatha plan; the original mandapa is lost and the garbhagriha sits below ground level.', 'Look for later masonry repairs and reused stonework.', 'Mahashivratri', 'The sanctum holds a svambhu-style jaladhari without a Shiva linga.', 'Best visited in cooler months for long heritage walks.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"label":"Ballaleshwar temple, Un (Commons file description)","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:0102221_Ballaleswar_temple,_Un_056.jpg"}]', 3, 'seed', 'Ballaleshwar temple, Un (Commons file description)', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:0102221_Ballaleswar_temple,_Un_056.jpg', 'verified', 'high', 1.000, '2026-02-19 09:48:12', '2026-03-17 06:20:00', 0),
